      "statement": "Taken together, the four documents do not verify the proposed assurances. Dispatch: the documented promise is within two working days after payment confirmation, excluding preordered goods—not a guarantee of next-working-day dispatch for every paid order. Returns: the assurance about personalized goods contradicts their explicit exclusion. The policy accepts unopened goods within ten calendar days when a receipt is provided, subject to that exclusion. Postage: payment for every return is unsupported; Moss pays return postage for goods damaged in transit if photographs were recorded on delivery. Responsibility for change-of-mind return postage and its cost are unstated, so neither free returns nor a customer charge can be inferred. Pickup: indefinite holding without written approval contradicts the three-working-day holding period after the ready notice. Collection beyond that period requires a written extension; without one, the order is cancelled."
    },
